# The source list, in one place instead of five.
#
# Every build in this tree compiles the same core and differs only in which
# backend it adds: the console/X11 one adds nothing, the three Qt ones add
# qtdriver.cpp and qtdialog.cpp (and qttest.cpp when the suite is compiled
# in), and the Windows one adds wdialog.cpp and wdriver.cpp. That was true
# before this file existed too -- it was just written out five times, and
# adding one source file meant editing five makefiles. Work log item 96
# records the day that bit: "five makefiles gained the object", one edit
# per file, and nothing in the tree would have noticed a missed one except
# a link error in whichever build was compiled last.
#
# So: add a source file here, once, in the group it belongs to. No makefile
# needs to change.
#
# The groups exist for one reason beyond tidiness -- they preserve each
# build's original link order exactly, so the four Linux binaries come out
# byte-for-byte identical to the hand-written lists they replaced. The
# Windows build listed the same files in a different order (alphabetical,
# with wdialog/wdriver in the middle), so its objects are ordered by these
# groups now; same set, same program, different layout.

# The engine: everything that computes a chart or reads and writes one.
SRC_CORE = astrolog.cpp switch.cpp atlas.cpp calc.cpp charts0.cpp \
  charts1.cpp charts2.cpp charts3.cpp data.cpp express.cpp general.cpp \
  intrpret.cpp io.cpp matrix.cpp placalc.cpp placalc2.cpp

# The graphics half: chart drawing and the device backends it draws to.
SRC_GRAPHICS = xdata.cpp xgeneral.cpp xdevice.cpp xcharts0.cpp \
  xcharts1.cpp xcharts2.cpp xscreen.cpp

# The Swiss Ephemeris library, vendored. Upstream's files, not this
# fork's -- see CLAUDE.md on sweph.cpp's line endings.
SRC_SWISS = swecl.cpp swedate.cpp swehouse.cpp swejpl.cpp swemmoon.cpp \
  swemplan.cpp sweph.cpp swephlib.cpp

# The three backends. Exactly one of QT and WIN is compiled into a binary;
# TEST rides along with QT when the in-process suite is wanted (-DQTTEST).
SRC_QT   = qtdriver.cpp qtdialog.cpp
SRC_TEST = qttest.cpp
SRC_WIN  = wdialog.cpp wdriver.cpp
